<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<?xfa generator="AdobeLiveCycleDesignerES_V9.8.0.0.20140107.1.905771_SAP" APIVersion="3.4.11306.0"?><xdp:xdp xmlns:xdp="http://ns.adobe.com/xdp/" timeStamp="2019-03-20T10:38:44Z" uuid="48e65974-1d6d-4e04-ae68-5fb019af02a1">
<template xmlns:xliff="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.1" xmlns="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-template/2.8/">
   <tags xmlns="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-xliff/1.0/"><value id="N141"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xft-xliff="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-xliff/1.0/" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="2.5.9308.0"><p>Sub: Reminder for Outstanding Dues</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>You are one of our valued customers and we are thankful to you for availing 24X7 Piped Natural Gas supply. During verification of our records, it is observed that the outstanding due in your account till date is Rs.<span xfa:embed="#floatingField000041" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/>.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Owing to your preoccupation, you may have missed the payment of gas bills.Through this reminder,we request you to make the payment within seven days of receipt of this letter to enable us to continue to provide better services to you .We provide various convenient options for Bill payment. You can choose any mode of payment convenient to you.The information on various modes of payment is provided in the PNG bill.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Should you find any discrepancies, please do bring it to our notice. If you have already made the payment, please ignore this reminder and forward the payment details to us at the above mentioned address or you may contact us at 1800 102 9282, or write to us at<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff;text-decoration:underline">gailgashelpline@gail.co.in</span>.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Inconvenience caused, if any, is sincerely regretted. We assure you of our best services always.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Thanking you,</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Yours truly,</p><p style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold">Gail Gas Limited</p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="color:#c0c0c0">This is a computer generated letter requires no signature. If you are not using gas,Kindly inform us the same on<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="tab-interval:0.393in;color:#0000ff;text-decoration:underline">gailgashelpline@gail.co.in</p><p style="tab-interval:0.393in;color:#0000ff;text-decoration:underline"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                                 </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p></body></value><value id="N330"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xft-xliff="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-xliff/1.0/" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="2.5.9308.0"><p style="text-decoration:none">To,</p><p style="text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p></body></value><value id="N67"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xft-xliff="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-xliff/1.0/" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="2.5.9308.0"><p style="text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                               </span><span style="font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold">Gail Gas Limited</span></p><p style="text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">      </span><span style="font-size:14pt">( A wholly own subsidiary of Gail(INDIA) Limited )</span></p><p style="text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                               </span><span style="font-size:14pt"> A-1,Sector-2,Noida,U.P</span></p></body></value><value id="N739">BP Number:-</value><value id="N795">Customer Name:-</value><value id="N851">               Date:-</value><value id="N879">G V_ ADDRES S</value><value id="N885"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xft-xliff="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-xliff/1.0/" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="2.5.9308.0"><p>Address:-<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField018467" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/></p></body></value></tags>
